	"journal": "I faced him in his throne hall. He Pushed on the metal inside me until I burned it all away. Breeze's vial let me reach the crowd in the square, calming their fear and then setting their anger loose. When he stumbled I tore his bracers off with iron, and he was only a man, a very old one. The city is awake. Elend means to help it decide what comes next. So do I.",
